  "fnthinkConsentGateTitle": "This step routes content through the server",
  "fnthinkConsentGateMsg": "\"{action}\" needs the \"content relayed through the server\" consent first: everything in this family lives on that relay server (send/receive, storing and revoking ingress endpoints, pairing relationships, channel sends), and using it requires agreeing. The explanation and the consent button are on the \"Fnthink Push → Receive\" page (the full text is readable before you agree). Once you have agreed, come back here and tap this step again.",
